                                                "description": "Request a replacement email for this assignment's linked active, verified customer account. Accepts no recipient. Shares 60-second cooldown and five sends/hour per assignment with customer requests. Returns refreshed assignment with pending_handover, masked_recipient, otp_email_status (queued/sent/failed), expiry and resend_available_at. Old codes and queued jobs are invalidated. Queued/sent does not confirm inbox delivery."
