                                        "description": "Password login for any active, verified role. No login OTP or email is required. HTTP 200 returns token, user, roles and permissions; Next.js stores the token only in httpOnly cookies. Ten requests/minute per visitor IP. Unverified accounts receive email_verification_required (403).",
