                                                    "options": {
                                                        "raw": {
                                                            "language": "json"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "description": "Passwordless email OTP login for existing active, verified accounts only. HTTP 202 returns login_otp_required with challenge_id, masked_recipient, expires_in (300), expires_at, resend_after (60) and resend_available_at. No user, token or OTP in this response. SMTP delivery is queued via database; a running worker is required. Unknown/inactive/unverified/pending-activation accounts receive the same generic rejection. Requests and resends share a 60-second cooldown and independent five-send/hour account and IP limits.",
